odyssey (1.6.0-rc1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix SSL_CTX cache (#1627)
  * fix: require a full-length SCRAM client proof (#1616)
  * Add virtual "odyssey.pooling_mode" GUC. (#1607)
  * Add cancel_rate_limit (#1603)
  * Forcely close OOMed connections (#1604)
  * Add autoconf support (#1598)
  * Introduce new counters for clients waiting for a route (#1507)
  * Add odyssey.opportunistic_acquire GUC (#1583)
  * Track UNLISTEN executed by extended proto
  * Unpin backend on UNLISTEN by simple query (#1573)
  * Rate limit client connections accept (#1550)
  * Add virtual odyssey.version GUC (#1547)
  * listen-level balancing section override (#1537)
  * listen-level balancing_method override (#1535)
  * ref counters for global pstmts map (#1515)
  * support FreeBSD build (#1517)
  * correct support for "allow" for backends (#1514)
  * keepalive parameters in rule config (#1513)
  * Add support for "prefer" mode of tls (#1511)
  * add listen-level storage failover (#1502)
  * add portal tacking on client side (#1494)
  * az_aware option (#1479)
  * OpenSSL 4 compatibility (#1466)
  * simple mac os support (#1467)
  * scram-passthrough impl (#1463)

